Error [jet.MarkedFunctionValue]: `bump` changes the script's `count`, so it can't be used as a function value
  --> tests/ui/script_function_that_changes_a_variable_as_a_value.jet:7:6
    |
  7 | f := bump
    |      ^^^^
 Why: Each call of `bump` passes the script's `count` to its extra `&` parameter `count:`, and a function value has no place for it
 Fix: Call `bump` directly, or pass a lambda that makes that call
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0227
